WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:02.690
Here's how Stag Hunt
works for investors.

2
00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.160
It's free.

3
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.560
Sign up with your email, and say
the largest check you'd write.

4
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.090
You only see deals that fit it.

5
00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:12.450
You say in writing
whether you're accredited,

6
00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:14.770
and promise to keep deals confidential.

7
00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:17.570
Only members who say they're
accredited see deals,

8
00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:20.020
30 days after that statement.

9
00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:23.110
You start in a hunt,
a group that shares deals.

10
00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:26.990
When you meet a founder worth backing,
you can share the deal there.

11
00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:29.980
On other members' deals,
you answer one question:

12
00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:31.180
want to meet the team?

13
00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:33.540
You answer before seeing
anyone else's call,

14
00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:34.940
and you can't change it.

15
00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:37.810
A yes is not a promise to invest.

16
00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:40.730
If you invest, you do
it directly with the company.

17
00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:43.910
Stag Hunt never holds or moves money.

18
00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:45.560
Every call is kept.

19
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.360
When outcomes are known,
your record shows which you got right.

20
00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:52.820
Startup investing is risky:
most startups fail.

21
00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:54.780
This isn't investment advice.

22
00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.100
Join free at staghunts.com.

